# Copy to `.env` to override. Every variable here is optional.

# Base URL the client prefixes onto API requests. Defaults to `/api`.
#
# Leave this unset for local development: the client calls same-origin `/api/*`
# and the Vite dev server proxies those to the API (see vite.config.ts), so
# there is no CORS setup and no hardcoded host. Set it only when the API is
# served from a different origin - and add CORS to the API first, as it has none.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
